@Funko_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5052

### Listar todos los funkos
GET {{Funko_Api_HostAddress}}/api/funkos
Accept: application/json

### Buscar por nombre
GET {{Funko_Api_HostAddress}}/api/funkos/buscar?nombre=Batman
Accept: application/json

### Obtener un funko
GET {{Funko_Api_HostAddress}}/api/funkos/1
Accept: application/json

### Crear un funko
POST {{Funko_Api_HostAddress}}/api/funkos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Batman",
  "price": 15.99,
  "stock": 10,
  "categoriaName": "Marvel"
}

### Actualizar un funko
PUT {{Funko_Api_HostAddress}}/api/funkos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Batman",
  "price": 19.99,
  "stock": 8,
  "categoriaName": "Marvel"
}

### Actualizar solo el precio
PATCH {{Funko_Api_HostAddress}}/api/funkos/1/precio
Content-Type: application/json

19.99

### Ajustar stock (negativo descuenta)
PATCH {{Funko_Api_HostAddress}}/api/funkos/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

-2

### Eliminar un funko
DELETE {{Funko_Api_HostAddress}}/api/funkos/1

### Listar categorías
GET {{Funko_Api_HostAddress}}/api/categorias
Accept: application/json

### Obtener una categoría
GET {{Funko_Api_HostAddress}}/api/categorias/1
Accept: application/json
